sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as Person 1 React
    participant API as Person 3 Express
    participant Auth as AuthService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Runner as Person 4 Runner

    Note over User,DB: Username and password login
    User->>UI: Enter credentials and click Enter the arena
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    API->>Auth: verifyCredentials(username, password)
    Auth->>DB: Find active user and password hash
    DB-->>Auth: User record
    Auth->>DB: Insert hashed server-side session
    DB-->>Auth: Session created
    Auth-->>API: Session cookie parameters
    API-->>UI: 204 + Set-Cookie HttpOnly Secure SameSite=Lax
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/users/me
    API->>DB: Read user summary
    DB-->>API: id, username, totalPoints
    API-->>UI: 200 user summary
    UI-->>User: Navigate to /dashboard

    Note over User,DB: Dashboard initialization
    par Current user
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/users/me
        API->>DB: Read active user
        DB-->>API: User summary
        API-->>UI: 200 user summary
    and Leaderboard
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/leaderboard?limit=20
        API->>DB: Users ordered by total_points DESC
        DB-->>API: Page of leaderboard entries
        API-->>UI: 200 entries + nextCursor
    end

    Note over User,Runner: Run Code is practice and never changes lives or points
    User->>UI: Click Run code
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/matches/:matchId/run
    API->>DB: Verify session, match membership and current exercise
    DB-->>API: Starter context and public tests
    API->>Runner: POST /internal/v1/execute mode=PUBLIC_RUN
    Runner-->>API: Verdict + safe diagnostics
    API-->>UI: 200 run result
    UI-->>User: Render output panel

    Note over User,DB: Account deletion keeps historical match integrity
    User->>UI: Confirm Delete my account
    UI->>API: DELETE /api/v1/users/me
    API->>DB: Transaction: anonymize user, revoke sessions, exclude from leaderboard
    DB-->>API: Transaction committed
    API-->>UI: 204 + clear session cookie
    UI-->>User: Clear client state and navigate to /login

